const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文描绘不同法律环境下大公司最终所有权和控制权的结构。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper maps ultimate ownership and control at large companies across differing legal environments. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"研究根据控制链、投票权和最终所有者识别规则比较跨国公司样本。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It compares company samples using control chains, voting rights, and ultimate-owner identification rules. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要公司实体、股权与投票权、控制链、披露版本、国家制度口径和观察日期。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Inputs are company entities, equity and voting rights, control chains, disclosure versions, country definitions, and observation dates. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"其价值在于说明所有权与控制权不能仅凭直接持股读出；它不对任何公司当前控制人或治理质量作断言。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"It shows why direct shareholding alone need not reveal ownership and control; it does not assert a current controller or governance quality for a company. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"冻结公司范围和控制阈值，保存股权结构披露版本，处理交叉持股与多层实体，并按披露可得时间连接。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Freeze company scope and control threshold; retain ownership-disclosure versions; handle cross-holdings and multilayer entities; link by disclosure availability. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (1999)。所有权网络会变化，跨国披露口径也不同；历史映射不能被当作实时受益所有人或治理评分。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (1999). Ownership networks and disclosure practices change; a historical map is not a real-time beneficial-owner record or governance score. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00115",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (1999) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Corporate Ownership Around the World”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。所有权网络会变化，跨国披露口径也不同；历史映射不能被当作实时受益所有人或治理评分。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Corporate Ownership Around the World”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
